Here is a summary of how I commonly configure Nginx configuration files to route requests based on the request origin.

```
LB → Nginx → Rails
```

<!-- more -->

## Nginx Configuration

- conf.d/default.conf

```
# cannot allow ip direct
server {
  listen       80;
  server_name  _;
  return       444;
}

# healthcheck from LB
server {
  listen 80 default_server;
  listen [::]:80 default_server;
  root /work/app/public;

